[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-CONTACT-SHARING
TITLE: Contact Sharing

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-12
TITLE: Home Address Sharing
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let a member choose to share that member's full Home Address or to keep that Home Address redacted.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The member chooses whether other members see the full Home Address or only its redacted form. This requirement does not apply to the Mailing Address.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-80
TITLE: Administrator Home Address Display
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let an administrator set any member's Home Address display to the full Home Address or to redacted.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An administrator can change the same Home Address display setting that the member can choose. The redacted display is the city and state. This requirement does not apply to the Mailing Address.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-44
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-48
TITLE: Secondary Email Sharing
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let a member choose to share that member's Secondary Email when a Secondary Email is provided.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A member who has given a Secondary Email chooses whether other members can see it.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-49
TITLE: Secondary Phone Number Sharing
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let a member choose to share that member's Secondary Phone Number when a Secondary Phone Number is provided.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A member who has given a Secondary Phone Number chooses whether other members can see it.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

