[[/SECTION]]

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-20
TITLE: Password Replacement
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let a logged-in member replace that member's password.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A logged-in member has to be able to replace that member's password. Passwords are held outside the Unified Backend. This requirement does not define password recovery.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-MEMBER-LIST
TITLE: Member List

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-21
TITLE: Member List
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL provide a list of members to a logged-in member.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A logged-in member can retrieve the members. This requirement does not limit the list to active members.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-36
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-22
TITLE: Member List Filtering
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let a logged-in member filter the member list by the account fields that member can view.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An administrator can view every account field, so an administrator can filter by every account field. Any other logged-in member can filter by the fields in the other-member view. This requirement does not add filter criteria beyond the fields that member can view.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-36
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-81
TITLE: Permission Modification
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let an administrator modify the permission sets of a member.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An administrator can grant and remove a member's permission sets. Assignment remains limited to permissions lower than that administrator's own permissions. This requirement does not name the permission sets.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-46
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

